        <mxCell id="note-0" value="&lt;b&gt;Reservation (BR-08, §5.4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Not an entity: 1..5 Booking rows sharing reservationCode,&lt;br&gt;the dates, the booker and one payOS gatewayOrderCode.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Invariants&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;checkOutDate &amp;gt; checkInDate;  nights() ≤ 30  (BR-07)&lt;br&gt;adults ≥ 1;  adults + children ≤ RoomType.capacity  (BR-13)&lt;br&gt;bookingCode = HMS-YYYYMMDD-XXXXX[-n]  (BR-11)&lt;br&gt;status only along BookingStateMachine (§6.4)&lt;br&gt;InventoryHold expires after 15 min — TTL index  (BR-10)&lt;br&gt;Room is allocated only at check-in (UC-R08)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F9A825;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="480" width="450" height="178" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
